{"version":1,"content":"<p>自動駕駛出租車公司Waymo確認將於2028年1月結束與Uber在美國奧斯汀和亞特蘭大市場的獨家合作關係。屆時，Waymo將通過自己的手機應用程式直接向乘客提供服務，而不再完全依賴Uber平台進行運營。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585050.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T18:45:24.358350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T18:26:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:17.397789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:17.397789+00:00","content_hash":"7a428d840be7689bcb99cac79d9bf876e603f5f4f3e8c742d818d5df2b6840d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}